ermes Agent...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">📥 Pulling latest code...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">Already up to date.  (or: Updating abc1234..def5678)</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">📦 Updating dependencies...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">✅ Dependencies updated</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">🔍 Checking for new config options...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">✅ Config is up to date  (or: Found 2 new options — running migration...)</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">🔄 Restarting gateways...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">✅ Gateway restarted</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">✅ Hermes Agent updated successfully!</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">tail</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">-f</span><span class=\"token plain\"> ~/.hermes/logs/update.log</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--version</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">/update</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">cd</span><span class=\"token plain\"> /path/to/hermes-agent</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Activate the venv you created during install (outside the source tree)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">export</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">VIRTUAL_ENV</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;</span><span class=\"token string environment constant\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">$HOME</span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">/.hermes/venvs/hermes-dev&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249)\">export</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token assign-left variable